(0049) // TODO - the latest function here is Do_LineLength_Scan which used to call ScanFreqs
(0050) // but now has a better (more memory-efficient, more robust to noise tbc) minimum
(0051) // detection algorithm
(0052) // Next step is to use this algorithm in VSWR scanning, and factor it into a 
(0053) // mindetect function if that makes sense to do
